  "questionEn": "Where is this conversation taking place? — Who is last in the queue? — I am, but the cashier said there are only a few tickets left for the 5 o'clock showing. — That's all right, I'll wait. — How many tickets would you like? — Only two. — I want five tickets. If there aren't that many, I'll let you go ahead of me. Maybe you'll get two tickets. — Thank you very much.",
