  "questionEn": "Where is this conversation taking place? — Excuse me, this is my seat. — I think you are mistaken. Here is my ticket. — Look, your seat is in row 12. — Well, which row is this? Could I have made a mistake? — Yes! It says here: row 10. — I'm sorry. I'll move right away; the performance is about to start. — No problem.",
