  "questionEn": "When is this conversation taking place? — I hope it will be a good concert. I barely managed to get a ticket. — Here is the program; in the first part it is mainly Georgian pop singers performing. — As far as I know, foreign singers are taking part too. — Yes, after the intermission, in the second part of the concert. — I have not been to a concert like this for a long time; I was glad to come. — Come on, let's go into the hall and take our seats. — Let's not forget to switch off our phones. — Good thing you reminded me. Let's go to my place after the concert. — Not today; it will be late.",
